msgstr "OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:59
#: 10fe328c15124e278124538acecb4c1a 1f2e2e87d77b4cc3a3d836984c1f54f5
#: 20d22c26a32141d5a261c53984c3190d 3356728698254ddf95e3d75577de77c1
#: 75fc91e2c4534c4aa6f1a1b0e2220140 bd0b309577654b00ba38c320c91d89c1
msgid ""
"MicoAir743-AIO supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort can be used "
"simultaneously and is pre-configured on SERIAL2 but can be supported on any "
"spare UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"MicoAir743-AIO 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的内置 OSD。外置 OSD 如 DJI 或 DisplayPort"
" 可同时启用，默认预配置于 SERIAL2，也可在任何空闲 UART 上使用。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:62
